CORE
main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 2 --allow-pointer-unsoundness --no-por --thread-symmetry exact
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^thread symmetry: 1 pair of 2 threads$
--
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
The mutex model stores its owner's identity, but a thread only compares it with
its own, so two threads that lock the same mutex are still interchangeable.
